        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00111:alt:fig-00009-alt",
          "text": "Acetylene reacts with sodium amide, ammonia, bromopropane, in tetrahydrofuran to form 1-pentyne. It reacts with hydrogen, Lindlar catalyst to form 1-pentene which reacts with HBr in ether to form 2-bromopentane. "
