          "caption": null,
          "media": {
            "alt": {
              "segmentId": "m00111:alt:fig-00025-alt",
              "text": "The figure shows two catalytic hydrogenation reactions. The first reaction is an alkyne reacting to form an alkane. The second reaction is an alkyne reacting to form a cis alkene."
